{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <datamodel>\n    <data id=\"count\" expr=\"0\"/>\n    <data id=\"done\" expr=\"false\"/>\n    <data id=\"user\" expr=\"({name:'bob'})\"/>\n  </datamodel>\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry><raise name=\"go\"/></onentry>\n    <transition event=\"go\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-misnamed-required-attribute.scxml"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":1,"notes":0,"total":1,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-misnamed-required-attribute.scxml"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":4,"byteOffset":274,"endColumn":25,"endLine":8,"startColumn":21,"startLine":8},"insertedContent":{"text":"event"}}]}],"description":{"text":"rename `name` to `event`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-misnamed-required-attribute.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":25,"endLine":8,"startColumn":21,"startLine":8}}}],"message":{"markdown":"`<raise>` requires `event` but has `name`, which it does not accept\n\n**Note:** the W3C SCXML 1.0 schema rejects this under XML Schema constraint `cvc-complex-type.3.2.2`: Attribute 'name' is not allowed for this element\n\n**Help:** did you mean `event=\"go\"`? rename `name` to `event` to keep the value\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §4.2 <raise>\n\n**Spec:** XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type) (`cvc-complex-type.3.2.2`)","text":"`<raise>` requires `event` but has `name`, which it does not accept"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":278,"start":274},"category":"schema"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"missing required `event`"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/xsd-misnamed-required-attribute.scxml"},"region":{"endColumn":20,"endLine":8,"startColumn":15,"startLine":8}}}],"ruleId":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2"}],"tool":{"driver":{"informationUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/scxml/","name":"scxml-validator","rules":[{"defaultConfiguration":{"level":"error"},"fullDescription":{"text":"SCXML elements accept only their declared attributes; extension attributes must be namespace-qualified"},"help":{"text":"How to fix: correct the attribute name, remove it, or qualify an extension attribute with a namespace prefix.\n\nSpecification: XML Schema 1.0 Part 1 §3.4.4 Element Locally Valid (Complex Type)\n\nRun `scxml-cli --explain XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2` for examples."},"helpUri":"https://www.w3.org/TR/xmlschema-1/#cvc-complex-type","id":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2","name":"XSD-cvc-complex-type.3.2.2","properties":{"category":"schema"},"shortDescription":{"text":"an attribute is not declared for this element"}}],"semanticVersion":"0.2.0"}}}],"version":"2.1.0"}